Subject: [PATCH 29/29] inkling2: Mini's fp8 key widening under the kernel
 contract

The widening kernel gets a float64 reference, a control that swaps the
K and V scales, and nvcc 13.0 and 13.3 records. It needs sm_89 for the
e4m3 conversion, like the rest of the fp8 prompt path.
